  "bio": "Andre Harke, based in Dortmund, Germany, is a proficient tattoo artist who specializes in dotwork and black&gray styles. He is notably professional, bringing visual artistry and unique craftsmanship to his role at 'pechschwarztattoo'. Andre can be directly contacted for appointments, exhibiting a commitment to accessibility and professionalism in his career.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Dortmund, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany"
